ng","settings":{"text":"<h3>How Pre-Order works<\/h3>","width":"fit-content","max_width":"narrow","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}},"accordion_cNMQDg":{"type":"accordion","name":"t:names.accordion","settings":{"icon":"caret","dividers":true,"type_preset":"h5","inherit_color_scheme":true,"color_scheme":"","border":"none","border_width":1,"border_opacity":100,"border_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{"accordion_row_hhKbAV":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"PDP experience","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_XH4zWU":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>HotWax helps set clear expectations and reduce post-purchase inquiries about delivery timelines. If an item is not yet in stock but incoming inventory is confirmed, HotWax displays a “Pre-Order” button and shows the expected arrival date based on purchase order timelines. This lets customers place their order confidently, knowing when the item is expected to ship.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_XH4zWU"]},"accordion_row_BeFmNh":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Inventory availability","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_RBRABV":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Future inventory data is automatically fetched by reading POs from procurement systems. Alternatively, merchants also have the flexibility to directly upload their POs using HotWax's Import App.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_RBRABV"]},"accordion_row_RKbwKf":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Mixed carts","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_xPjyGc":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>HotWax allows customers to add both in-stock and Pre-Order items to the same cart. Items are clearly labeled so customers understand which products will ship immediately and which will ship later when inventory becomes available.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_xPjyGc"]},"accordion_row_iw4F3q":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_row","settings":{"heading":"Customer communication","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_tfCKcV":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>HotWax sends order confirmation emails with Pre-Order details and promise dates so customers know exactly what they ordered and when it is expected to arrive. If an incoming purchase order is delayed or arrives early, HotWax automatically updates the promise date and notifies customers right away.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_tfCKcV"]},"accordion_row_UCwGEL":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Auto release Pre-Orders","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_MpGFxq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>HotWax automatically releases Pre-Orders once inventory arrives and promise date is reached. Retailers can define routing rules so Pre-Orders are fulfilled from the right locations. For example, during seasonal launches or holiday drops, Pre-Orders can be routed from central warehouses while store inventory remains available for walk-in customers.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_MpGFxq"]},"accordion_row_jRWGkc":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Control Pre-Order release","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_T7giax":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>HotWax's Pre-Order App lets retailers review total Pre-Orders for each product style and ba